  "worked_solution": "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point and go along with the flow (downward and to the right) until the trajectory intersects the $y$-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14118584/assets/7f98b4ad206556ac8a7c8eae16d216af9d91a375907e3fd058247e70195e1669.png)\n\n- After that, the trajectory continues going to the right and slightly upward to infinity.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14118584/assets/3ba48b118f4ed24dcf6866579fae201af0b36252e537ab99ac2b87e08a889e15.png)",
