  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-332837\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's sketch the trajectory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We start at the given point and go along with the flow (downward and to the right) until the trajectory intersects the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"59\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-73302ffb6348b29a0179b74fdfaa1a87\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/73302ffb6348b29a0179b74fdfaa1a87\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>After that, the trajectory continues going to the right and slightly upward to infinity.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-d6582a3ba7c321cf81f719d85dc842e6\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/d6582a3ba7c321cf81f719d85dc842e6\"></div></div>",
